FAIL testdata/bad/bad-timezone.yaml:8:15  PQ2010: "CET+1" is not a time zone this machine knows: unknown time zone CET+1

   6 |   - name: nightly
   7 |     cron: "0 3 * * *"
>  8 |     timezone: CET+1
                     ^

   Zones are IANA names, region and city, such as Europe/Oslo or America/New_York.
   Three letter abbreviations are ambiguous and are not accepted.

       timezone: Europe/Oslo

       paceq doctor    reports whether the zone database is readable at all

   paceq error PQ2010  for the full explanation
